Local terminal-first coding agent

Usage:
  pips [flags]
  pips [command]

Available Commands:
  acp              Serve Agent Client Protocol v1 over stdio
  agents           Inspect and create declarative Coding Agents
  completion       Generate shell completion
  config           Inspect effective configuration
  doctor           Check coding agent prerequisites
  exec             Run one non-interactive coding request
  help             Help about any command
  hooks            Review Coding lifecycle hooks
  plugin           Inspect portable Agent Plugins
  resume           Resume a durable coding session
  session          Inspect durable coding sessions
  ssh              Run Pips in a remote workspace
  version          Print build version information

Flags:
      --approval string     approval mode
      --config string       user configuration file
      --dynamic-subagents   enable Alpha custom subagents
  -h, --help                help for pips
      --mode string         operating mode (agent or plan)
      --model string        model in provider/model form
      --reasoning string    model reasoning level
      --sandbox string      sandbox mode
      --tool-search         enable deferred tool search
      --variant string      named model request preset
      --workspace string    workspace root (default ".")

Use "pips [command] --help" for more information about a command.
